<p>An approved claim is not always a fully paid claim. Many San Antonio homeowners and business owners receive a payment, call a contractor, and learn the money covers only part of the repair. An <strong>underpaid insurance claim in San Antonio</strong> usually comes down to a handful of causes: damage left out of the scope, quantities measured short, pricing that does not reflect current local costs, or depreciation and deductible math that was never clearly explained. The good news is that an estimate can be reviewed line by line, and missing or underpriced items can be documented and presented to the insurer.</p>

<h2>Signs Your Claim May Be Underpaid</h2>
